    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent. We talked about why it helps to choose a health care agent and to put wishes in writing while she is well. She named a health care agent, who is recorded in the chart and not named here, and took a medical power of attorney form and a directive form home to complete. She said what matters most to her is staying independent and being told the plain truth about her health so she can make her own decisions. She chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited next year or sooner if her health changes. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
